# `lib/` IS committed on purpose: this plugin is distributed through Git as well
# as npm, and a Git install gets the source tree, not a build output. Keeping the
# compiled host half, the bundled client half and the type declarations in the
# repository is what makes `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/dsh-skills-hub` work
# without the user running a build.
